# Raven: un-hide the directories Raven installs guidance into. ripgrep, fd and
# ast-grep share the same `ignore` crate, which skips dot-directories unless a
# negation says otherwise, so without these lines the first search an agent
# runs over its own instructions comes back empty and reads as clean (#238).
# Only the negation lines below are merged into a destination's own .ignore --
# see blocks.ensure_ignore_lines and common/.claude/docs/raven-namespace.md for
# how this file is merged (append-only, never a whole-file copy) rather than
# installed like most of common/.
!.agents/
!.claude/
!.codex/
!.raven/
